      "content": "- Add setting to set/reset hidden items password (stored locally)\n\n- To hide item:\n  long press (3–5 sec) on item → show hide option\n  if password not set → ask user to set it first → then hide item\n  if already set → directly hide\n\n- Hidden items should not show in main list\n\n- To view hidden items:\n  add new tab in library OR option in settings\n  when opening → ask for password → then show hidden items\n\n- Inside hidden items:\n  add select mode (toggle/tick)\n  user can select multiple items\n  then show \"Unhide\" option\n  clicking it will restore items back to main list\n\n- Add \"Unhide All\" option (optional)\n- Auto lock hidden items screen after app restart / inactivity\n- Show error on wrong password\n- Add \"Forgot password\" warning (since stored locally)\n- Optional: support fingerprint/biometric unlock",
